{
    "method": "billing.billingProductsSummaryGet",
    "toolName": "billing-products-summary-get",
    "operationId": "billing_products_summary_retrieve",
    "title": "Get every product in summary",
    "category": "Billing",
    "description": "Every product with its add-ons and the names of its features, without prices or plans. Use it to find the product, add-on or feature a question is about. A product or add-on says whether the organization subscribes to it. A feature says whether it is available to the organization, trials and overrides included, and lists the add-ons that carry it. For prices and plans, pass the product key to billing-product-get. Readable by any member. Beta: behind the organization-billing-api flag, and the output shape may change while it is.",
